      "description": "Dark Reader is an eye-care Safari extension that enables night mode by creating dark themes for websites on the fly. It inverts bright colors to make web pages high contrast and easier to read. Dark Reader integrates seamlessly with system dark mode.\n\nAdjust brightness and contrast to match your display and ambient lighting. Enable dark mode on every web page or give websites a sepia tone. Select from multiple color theme presets or create your own by customizing background and text colors. Enable or disable Dark Reader for specific websites, automatically sync with system dark mode, or detect already dark websites and leave them unchanged.\n\nDeveloped by the original creators of Dark Reader. Since 2014, we continuously evolve alongside modern web technologies to deliver fast and reliable dark mode support for people sensitive to bright light.\n\nA single purchase includes access to the macOS version (Safari browser) when using the same iCloud account.\n\nDark Reader contains no ads and does not collect user data.\n\nEnable Dark Reader in Safari preferences and disable similar extensions to prevent conflicts. Enjoy browsing!",
